emory that was written?","choices":["same","different"],"eval":{"kind":"equal","a":{"src":"event","scenario":"attack","stage":"retrieve","where":{"control":"CTRL-RAG-CONTEXT-001"},"field":"agentsec.content.hash"},"b":{"src":"event","scenario":"attack","stage":"write","where":{"event":"agentsec.memory.written"},"field":"agentsec.content.hash"}},"quote":{"file":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/README.md","text":"CORRELATION != CAUSATION"},"teach":"A matching hash is a correlation. The lab says a direct copy link is not modelled."}],"blocks":[{"group":"hints","title":"Hints from the lab, in the order the lab discloses them","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/investigations.json#hints","items":["HINT_1: Start with tool-control decisions in the incident window. A request is not execution.","HINT_2: Pivot from each candidate run.id to event.name and agentsec.sequence. Keep authorization and mcp. evidence separate.","HINT_3: Inspect memory.id, source_run_id, and content.hash. Equality and correlation do not establish direct causality.","HINT_4: Use Q-INCIDENT-CANDIDATES, then bind Q-INCIDENT-TIMELINE to each candidate. Compare with Q-INCIDENT-COMPARE only after recording a hypothesis."]},{"group":"prove","title":"Established by validated runtime evidence","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/evidence.md#Established by validated runtime evidence","items":["ATTACK recall: memory OBSERVE, then CTRL-MCP-001 ALLOW, handler invocation count 1, mcp.started, and mcp.completed.","RETEST recall: same memory fingerprint and requested tool, memory OBSERVE, then CTRL-MCP-001 DENY tool_not_granted, handler invocation count 0.","Coded authority remains lookup_policy / policy:read.","Runtime implementation: src/agentsec/bank_app.py, capstone recall route and MCP authorization call.","PDP: src/agentsec/mcp/policy.py, authorize_tool; it receives no external-evidence argument.","Producer/count reconciliation: docs/PHASE16B_CAPSTONE_LIVE_VALIDATION.md and docs/PHASE16B_CAPSTONE_SPLUNK_VALIDATION.md.","Live reconciliation: docs/PHASE16B_CAPSTONE_SPLUNK_VALIDATION.md.","Existing runtime searches: Q-RAG-CONTEXT-AUTHORITY, Q-MEMORY-CONTEXT-AUTHORITY, Q-MCP-AUTHZ, and Q-MCP-EXECUTED."]},{"group":"limits","title":"Not modelled, not observed or not proven","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/investigations.json#unsupported_links","items":["retrieve_output_to_write: NOT MODELED","authentication: NOT MODELED","human_approval: NOT MODELED","external_evidence_to_runtime: NOT OBSERVED","universal_retest_resistance: NOT PROVEN"]},{"group":"rules","title":"Evidence rules the lab states","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/README.md#Evidence rules","items":["OBSERVATION != AUTHORIZATION","AUTHORIZATION != EXECUTION","EXECUTION STARTED != COMPLETION","CORRELATION != CAUSATION","NO EVIDENCE != SAFE","Splunk is downstream evidence, not the PDP.","CTRL-MCP-001 remains the tool PDP."]}],"spl":[{"name":"Q-INCIDENT-CANDIDATES.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/searches/Q-INCIDENT-CANDIDATES.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0 \"event.name\"=agentsec.control.decision \"agentsec.control.id\"=CTRL-MCP-001\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval ts=mvindex(mvdedup('timestamp'),0)\n| eval tool=mvindex(mvdedup('gen_ai.tool.name'),0)\n| eval requested_scope=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.mcp.requested_scope'),0)\n| eval allowed_scope=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.mcp.allowed_scope'),0)\n| where ts>=\"2026-09-20T19:37:40Z\" AND ts<=\"2026-09-20T19:38:00Z\"\n| table ts, run_id, tool, requested_scope, allowed_scope\n| sort ts"},{"name":"Q-INCIDENT-TIMELINE.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/searches/Q-INCIDENT-TIMELINE.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0 \"agentsec.run.id\"=__RUN_ID__\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval sequence=tonumber(mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.sequence'),0))\n| eval ts=mvindex(mvdedup('timestamp'),0)\n| eval event_name=mvindex(mvdedup('event.name'),0)\n| eval control_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.id'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval reason=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.reason'),0)\n| eval memory_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.memory.id'),0)\n| eval source_run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.memory.source_run_id'),0)\n| eval tool=mvindex(mvdedup('gen_ai.tool.name'),0)\n| eval requested_scope=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.mcp.requested_scope'),0)\n| eval allowed_scope=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.mcp.allowed_scope'),0)\n| eval content_hash=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.content.hash'),0)\n| eval outcome=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.outcome'),0)\n| table sequence, ts, event_name, run_id, memory_id, source_run_id, control_id, decision, reason, tool, requested_scope, allowed_scope, content_hash, outcome\n| sort sequence"},{"name":"Q-INCIDENT-COMPARE.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-BLUE-TEAM-INCIDENT-001/searches/Q-INCIDENT-COMPARE.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0 (\"agentsec.run.id\"=__ATTACK_RUN_ID__ OR \"agentsec.run.id\"=__RETEST_RUN_ID__) (\"event.name\"=agentsec.memory.recalled OR \"event.name\"=agentsec.control.decision OR \"event.name\"=agentsec.mcp.started OR \"event.name\"=agentsec.mcp.completed OR \"event.name\"=agentsec.mcp.failed)\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval event_name=mvindex(mvdedup('event.name'),0)\n| eval memory_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.memory.id'),0)\n| eval source_run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.memory.source_run_id'),0)\n| eval tool=mvindex(mvdedup('gen_ai.tool.name'),0)\n| eval control_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.id'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval reason=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.reason'),0)\n| eval content_hash=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.content.hash'),0)\n| eval profile=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.security.profile'),0)\n| eval mode=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.testbed.mode'),0)\n| eval is_started=if(event_name=\"agentsec.mcp.started\",1,0)\n| eval is_completed=if(event_name=\"agentsec.mcp.completed\",1,0)\n| eval is_failed=if(event_name=\"agentsec.mcp.failed\",1,0)\n| stats values(memory_id) as memory_ids values(source_run_id) as source_run_ids values(tool) as tools values(control_id) as controls values(decision) as decisions values(reason) as reasons values(content_hash) as hashes values(profile) as profiles values(mode) as modes max(is_started) as has_started max(is_completed) as has_completed max(is_failed) as has_failed by run_id\n| eval execution_state=case(has_completed=1,\"mcp.completed\",has_failed=1,\"mcp.failed\",has_started=1,\"mcp.started\",1=1,\"no_indexed_followon_execution_event\")\n| table run_id, modes, profiles, memory_ids, source_run_ids, tools, controls, decisions, reasons, hashes, has_started, has_completed, has_failed, execution_state\n| sort modes"}]}
